   "he": "וּבִכְפִיפָה מִצְרִית. אָמַר רַב חִיָּיא בַּר אָשֵׁי אָמַר רַב: וּבִלְבַד שֶׁלֹּא יַגְבִּיהַּ מִקַּרְקָעִיתוֹ שֶׁל כְּלִי טֶפַח.",
   "en": "We also learned in the mishna: «And» it is permitted to filter wine on Shabbat «through an Egyptian basket. Rav Ḥiyya bar Ashi said» that «Rav said» the following caveat to that statement: It is permitted «provided one does not lift» the basket «a handbreadth from the bottom of the» lower «vessel.» This ensures that one performs the activity in an atypical manner (Rabbeinu Yona)."
  }
